+// Desktop "本机配对" page.
+//
+// What it shows, and what it deliberately does not:
+//
+//   * the address the phone must reach, the one-time code, its countdown and a
+//     copyable `cloudterminal://pair?...` link, plus a scannable QR;
+//   * a truthful status line: relay online/offline, whether this app spawned the
+//     companion or attached to one the user started, and the bundled versions;
+//   * the sessions that actually exist on this machine. An empty list is shown
+//     as empty with a "create a session" action, never padded with placeholders;
+//   * the connected-client count only when the relay reported it. Otherwise the
+//     field reads 未知 — a fabricated 0 would be worse than no number.
